### server/discover — note the io.modelcontextprotocol/ui extension capability
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: server/discover

{
  "id": 1,
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "server/discover",
  "params": {
    "_meta": {
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities": { "extensions": { "io.modelcontextprotocol/ui": { "mimeTypes": ["text/html;profile=mcp-app"] } } },
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/clientInfo": { "name": "httpie", "version": "1.0" },
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion": "2026-07-28"
    }
  }
}

### tools/list — get-time carries _meta.ui.resourceUri linking it to the UI resource
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: tools/list

{
  "id": 1,
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "tools/list",
  "params": {
    "_meta": {
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities": {},
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/clientInfo": { "name": "httpie", "version": "1.0" },
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion": "2026-07-28"
    }
  }
}

### resources/read — fetch the ui:// app bundle (this is what the host renders in the iframe)
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: resources/read
Mcp-Name: ui://get-time/mcp-app.html

{
  "id": 1,
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "resources/read",
  "params": {
    "_meta": {
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities": {},
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/clientInfo": { "name": "httpie", "version": "1.0" },
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion": "2026-07-28"
    },
    "uri": "ui://get-time/mcp-app.html"
  }
}

### tools/call get-time — the app calls this (via the host) and renders {time}
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: tools/call
Mcp-Name: get-time

{
  "id": 1,
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "_meta": {
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities": {},
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/clientInfo": { "name": "httpie", "version": "1.0" },
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion": "2026-07-28"
    },
    "name": "get-time",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}
